msgstr "API 金鑰一定要有到期日。"

#. module: dobtor_apikey_scope
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dobtor_apikey_scope.form_res_users_key_description_scope
msgid ""
"The key will only carry the groups ticked below (intersected\n"
"                    with your own groups). Your base user type is always kept."
msgstr ""
"金鑰只會帶著下面勾起來的群組（再與你自己的群組取交集）。\n"
"                    你的基本使用者類型一定會保留。"

