#. module: dobtor_apikey_scope
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dobtor_apikey_scope.field_res_users_apikeys_scope__restrict
msgid ""
"When enabled, any request authenticated with this API key only carries the "
"selected access groups (intersected with the owner user's real groups), "
"regardless of the user's full permissions. Disable to fall back to standard "
"behaviour (full user rights)."
msgstr "開啟後，用這把 API 金鑰認證的每一個請求都只帶著選取的存取群組（再與擁有者實際的群組取交集），不管那位使用者本身有多少權限。關閉則回到原生行為（完整的使用者權限）。"

#. module: dobtor_apikey_scope
